{"id":"na092ae4abe","headline":"For every ₹1 spent on PM Modi's foreign visits since 2021, India received around ₹66,000 in FDI: Govt data shows - BusinessToday","summary":"A parliamentary reply put the cost of Prime Minister Narendra Modi's foreign visits at about ₹500 crore for 2021-2025. Over April 2021 to December 2025, India recorded $381.8 billion in foreign direct investment.","why":"Foreign direct investment is long-term capital that companies place in another country's factories, operations and assets, and it is a key indicator of an economy's attractiveness to investors.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Business Today","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/economy/story/for-every-rs1-spent-on-pm-modis-foreign-visits-since-2021-india-received-around-rs66000-in-fdi-govt-data-shows-547704-2026-08-06"},"sources":[{"name":"Business Today","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/economy/story/for-every-rs1-spent-on-pm-modis-foreign-visits-since-2021-india-received-around-rs66000-in-fdi-govt-data-shows-547704-2026-08-06"}],"published_at":"2026-08-06T11:11:59Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"af73b7b00efff223","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-06T11:11:59Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-06T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-279769.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"Thibaud","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.